    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n6782" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">cardu .s</span></b> , i (access. form <b><span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">cardus</span></b> , ūs,
		Edict. Diocl. p. 17; cf. <i><span class="en">Charis. p. 57</span></i>
		P.), m., <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>I.</b>
			<i>the thistle.</i>
		</div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>1.</b>
			<i>The wild thistle</i>, <i><span class="en">Verg. G. 1,
				152</span></i>; <i><span class="en">Col. 7, 8, 1</span></i>; <i><span class="en">Plin. 20,
				23, 99, § 262</span></i>; <i><span class="en">Veg. 1, 7,
				14</span></i>.—</div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b>
			<i>The esculent thistle</i> or <i>artichoke</i>, = cinara, <i><span class="en">Plin.
				19, 8, 43, § 152 sq.</span></i>;
				<i><span class="en">Pall. Mart. 9, 1, 3</span></i>;
					<i><span class="en">id. Oct. 11, 1</span></i>.</div>
